\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  confirms end of  \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention \highlight\uc2  even as peso drops\b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed plans to end its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program at the end of the month, even as the peso reached its lowest level since the bank began selling dollars in mid-July.\par \par \uc2 The program will end as scheduled on Sept. 30, after which the bank will only renew forward contracts as they expire, according to a statement released Monday. It will no longer sell dollars in the spot market.\par \par \uc2 The bank chose to make the announcement on a day when the peso was among the worst performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world amid broad risk aversion sentiment and as the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program begins to wind down.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciated 2.2% against the dollar, bringing its fall in the last three weeks to more than 12%. It currently stands at 992 pesos to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 "The Council remains committed to the floating exchange rate regime, reserving the option to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in exceptional circumstances if it considers that the smooth functioning of the financial market is at risk," the statement said. The program achieved its objective of assisting the "proper functioning of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market".\par \par \uc2 The bank will renew US$9.11 billion in forward sales \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  and any auctions that are declared void will be rescheduled for the following week. The renewal program will be valid until January 13, the monetary policy institute said.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, the bank announced plans to sell US$50 million a day in the spot market this week and renew a total of US$2.21 billion in forward sales. The forward renewal and rescheduling schedule will continue to be reported every Friday.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220927ei9r00af3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
