\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  says  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  program achieves objective\b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 September 2022\par 22:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds details, context)\par \par \uc2 Sept 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday that its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and dollar liquidity program, which began in mid July, has achieved its objective and will finalize on Sept. 30.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the program had achieved the "objective of helping the proper functioning of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, facilitating the adjustment of the economy and financial markets to external and internal conditions."\par \par \uc2 The institution said that as of Oct. 2, the bank will only offer stock renewal of forward dollar sales \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , at market conditions, for the equivalent of $9.11 billion.\par \par \uc2 "If an auction is declared void, this amount will be rescheduled for the following week," the banks said in a statement, adding that the renewal scheme will remain until Jan. 13, 2023. "Any changes to this renewal mechanism, as a result of changes in market conditions, will be announced in due course."\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced in July a $25 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the peso after it fell to a record low, saying that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had depreciated with unusually high intensity and volatility.\par \par \uc2 The peso hit 1,045.80 to the dollar in July before the program was announced. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was able to bring the exchange rate back to about 875 pesos per dollar, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit its lowest point in more than two months on Monday, closing at 992 pesos per dollar. (Reporting by Carolina Pulice and Anthony Esposito)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-9-29T20:43:25.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020220926ei9q03typ\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
