\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Chilean dollar continues its decline below $ 930 on new copper price hike\b0\par\par\uc2 396 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 On the fifth day since the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's banking \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  began, the dollar in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  marks this Friday new declines, dropping below the $ 930 barrier.\par \par \uc2 At the opening, the exchange rate fell $ 5.05 to $ 923, which places the Chilean peso as the fourth emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the best daily performance, according to Bloomberg.\par \par \uc2 This, while copper rises 1.94% on the \uc2 London Metal Exchange\uc2  to US$ 3.344 a pound, and the dollar index - which compares the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a basket of six other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  - falls 0.17% to 106.625 points.\par \par \uc2 "The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been trading flat for the past week, after the dollar's sharp fall due to the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to alleviate the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's pressure on the national economy. However, fears of a global recession as a result of the strong rate hikes being carried out by the world's main central banks to contain the escalation of prices is having a strong impact on the greenback", explains XTB Latam's senior market analyst, Juan Ortiz Godoy.\par \par \uc2 So far, the sale of dollars by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has totaled US$ 2,735 million at the close of trading on Thursday. While spot sales represent 70.75% of the total, forward sales account for the remaining 29.25%.\par \par \uc2 This is in line with the program of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and preventive provision of liquidity in dollars, which includes an amount of up to US$ 25 billion until September 30, 2022, with the sale of spot dollars for up to US$ 10 billion and the sale of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedging instruments for an amount of up to US$ 10 billion.\par \par \uc2 At the international level, attention is focused on how the greenback may be influenced by the monetary policy meeting of the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2 , where it is expected to raise the interest rate by 75 basis points next week to control inflation.\par \par \uc2 "We believe that the exchange rate will continue its upward trend despite the drops it has been experiencing in some days. The exchange rate could go for $ 915 - $ 920, to possibly rebound to $ 900 and continue its upward trend if we see further falls in copper and an appreciation of the dollar at a global level", states Godoy.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220722ei7m00aeg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
