\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Dollar continues to plummet following  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 431 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juli 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The dollar in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to show signs that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local greenback market is having an effect. The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  started the day down, and the Chilean peso is also favored by the rise in the price of copper.\par \par \uc2 "At the moment it has been seen that the objective (of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been achieved, but we will pay close attention to the economic data that we will know in the United States in the next few days, as well as the news regarding world economic growth", says the head of trading studies at Capitaria, Ricardo Bustamante.\par \par \uc2 However, the initial rise is the lowest since the autonomous agency announced the injection of US$25 billion into the dollar market through various exchange instruments.\par \par \uc2 At the beginning of \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar lost $7.07 with respect to yesterday's close and was trading at $919.95. Thus, the greenback is heading for its third consecutive day down, where it accumulates a loss of $131.1.\par \par \uc2 According to Bloomberg data, the dollar in Chile is at its lowest level in three weeks.\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso is also favored by the rise in the price of copper. The three-month reddish metal quotation gains 1.93% to a value of US$3.35 per pound.\par \par \uc2 "For today we expect a bearish day for the dollar against the peso, which could break $920 and go in search of $900 due to the appreciation that copper has brought, and due to the uncertainty before the US rate decision$, projects BeFX analyst Camilo Celed\u243\'00\'F3n.\par \par \uc2 However, the greenback at international level recovers again after three down days. The dollar index gained 0.24%.\par \par \uc2 Markets have cut expectations of a US interest rate hike of 100 basis points next week and now see a 23% probability of such a hike after authorities poured cold water on that option, notes Reuters.\par \par \uc2 "For the exchange rate we see a stable but downward price, thanks to the notorious advance in the copper price, the stable price of the dollar index and the still notorious effect of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in our country, which practically sold half of its dollar reserve in order to control the value of the exchange rate", states XTB Latam's senior market analyst, Francisco Roman.\par \par \uc2 So far today, the Chilean peso is the sixth most appreciated \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world against the dollar and the second among the group of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of emerging countries, according to Bloomberg.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220720ei7k00a0o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
