\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 New dollar records do not move the  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  and remains firm in its position of not  \highlight22\uc2 intervening \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 499 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juli 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The records set every day by the dollar for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  have an explanation and that is why the autonomous organization remains firm in its position of not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The vice-president of the entity, Pablo Garc\u237\'00\'EDa, also pointed out that their efforts are in containing inflation and not in the exchange rate policy, unless it presents movements that cannot be explained.\par \par \uc2 "There are many reasons that I could use to understand the dynamics and direction of the exchange rate issue, but for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's effect, we must remember that if the concern is inflation, the instrument is monetary policy. The exchange rate policy does not have the objective of maintaining an inflation control strategy, that is something we left behind many years ago", said Garc\u237\'00\'EDa in the framework of an Icare seminar.\par \par \uc2 The dollar again surpasses $930 in the face of a sharp drop in copper prices.In the activity called "Strengthening the Capital Market towards the Future" at the meeting "Chilean Capital Market: Improvements in Financing for SMEs and Individuals", Garc\u237\'00\'EDa defended the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's position, stating that the dollar is rising internationally, the price of copper is falling, we are facing "the worst quarter in equities in the world for many decades" and we have a "high deficit in our current account", among other reasons.\par \par \uc2 Economic activity confirms signs of deceleration: Imacec grew 6.4% in May"We have to take into account that it is not enough to observe exchange rate movements, but one has to see movements that are not substantially linked to more fundamental dynamics," he added.\par \par \uc2 The economist also highlighted that the measure of having a floating exchange rate allows for a better cushioning of external impacts, and reiterated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will only act in the dollar market in exceptional situations.\par \par \uc2 Jorge Selaive: "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is saying that the fall of the peso is explained by copper and the appreciation of the dollar I would suggest that they review their models"."\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has to be linked to movements that are producing significant financial tensions, liquidity problems, that there are problems with our fixed income and this is not being observed", concluded the economist, who invited people to give their opinion on the behavior of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in this matter, taking into consideration "the policy framework that we have and see through it how one takes certain eventual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  decisions".\par \par \uc2 Continued in PulsoPresident Boric is optimistic about the approval of the Tax Reform and does not rule out providing economic aid for the winter.Number of projects submitted for environmental evaluation falls to its lowest level since 1998, but investment amount increases by 33%.Tax reform to be presented this Friday and will include changes in taxes on the sale and rental of housing\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220701ei71009ku\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pi