\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Marcel dismisses government actions and ability to influence the dollar, but warns that impact on inflation is minor\b0\par\par\uc2 570 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The Minister of Finance, \uc2 Mario Marcel\uc2 , dismissed the Government's capacity to be able to take measures that could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the dollar market in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the quotation of the US \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  broke milestones every day. The Secretary of State pointed in this matter to the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and added that the work of the Executive must go on the side of how to cushion the effects of this rise in inflation.\par \par \uc2 "The Government cannot do much in exchange matters, because the sovereign funds have a very limited magnitude and very different from the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has international reserves, liquidity lines and has other mechanisms that it can use if it so decides", said Marcel in a press conference in La Moneda after a cabinet meeting.\par \par \uc2 Dollar continues unstoppable and registers new record highs in the face of the copper plungeThe former president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  took the opportunity to explain that the current rise of the dollar is explained by the weakening of copper and the monetary rate policy promoted by the \uc2 US Federal Reserve\uc2 , among other factors.\par \par \uc2 Former Minister of Finance Rodrigo Vald\u233\'00\'E9s adds to the position of not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the dollar market despite the new historical maximum."We have no control over those phenomena that occur at a global level and that are the ones that are pressuring the dollar at the margin. Now the exchange rate policy in Chile, as we well know, is the responsibility of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ", he added.\par \par \uc2 However, Marcel contextualized that the rise in the dollar does have an impact on inflation in Chile, but that in this case it would be lower as it is a rise generated by international and not local factors.\par \par \uc2 "But of course the increase is important and we will see how we can reinforce some protection and support mechanisms that we have implemented, which have the capacity to adjust to how inflation behaves in the country", concluded the Minister of Finance.\par \par \uc2 Tax reform The Minister of Finance was also asked about the tax reform, which will be presented next week. In this regard, Marcel highlighted the process of citizen dialogues on this issue and reiterated that this tax initiative is focused on people with higher incomes and mining.\par \par \uc2 "This is a reform in which the greatest contribution is going to come from those with higher incomes and from the sources of evasion and avoidance, which in our consultations emerged as one of the things that most outrages people", commented Marcel.\par \par \uc2 On the mining side, the Secretary of State will take the mining royalty proposal to the Senate, where such an initiative is being discussed.\par \par \uc2 "The details will be made known on the same day that the tax reform is presented", added Marcel, who scheduled for July 1st the activity to deliver the project in relation to taxes.\par \par \uc2 Continue in PulsePresident Boric after the end of the strike at Codelco: "We cannot allow economic development to be contradictory to care for the environment".Fintech validates government's indications to the projectOceana's latest offensive to overthrow the Dominga project before the Committee of Ministers"NotCo requests registration of alternative trademarks for Not Milk amidst conflict with dairy unionCentral Bank dismisses manager after scam of which he was victim this year\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220624ei6o00c1w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
