\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Former Finance Minister Rodrigo Vald\u233\'00\'E9s supports position of not  \highlight22\uc2 intervening \highlight\uc2  in dollar market despite new record high\b0\par\par\uc2 823 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The dollar in Chile continues its tendency to set a new record high each day, and experts support the position that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , for now, in the exchange market, despite the fact that the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is already above $900.\par \par \uc2 The dollar continues unstoppable and records new historical highs in the face of the copper plunge.Now it was the turn of former Finance Minister Rodrigo Vald\u233\'00\'E9s. "The strength of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is very limited. The effects every time the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  are seen over time, but they are not a magic ball that will return the exchange rate to $800, they are just a few pesos", said the economist in an interview with Radio Infinita.\par \par \uc2 Corbo dismisses \uc2 CB\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the rise of the dollar in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 : "You have to be Tarzan to change its appreciation".His position is similar to that of the former president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Vittorio Corbo\uc2 , and the current vice-president of the autonomous organization, Pablo Garc\u237\'00\'EDa.\par \par \uc2 The former Secretary of State during \uc2 Michelle Bachelet\uc2 's second government also warned that the dollar reserves are not enough to venture into an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in this market.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaffirms decision not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the dollar market in spite of new historical quotation."They are not to play at \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  as an Asian country, that is very dangerous, because one can run out of reserves when one really needs them", he added.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Catholic University\uc2  academic also pointed out that "there is nothing unusual in the market to suggest that an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would make it work better, and therefore, the effect would be very minimal".\par \par \uc2 In this line, Vald\u233\'00\'E9s dismissed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the dollar market in case there are pressures or calls from the political sector, such as the Congress. "Politicians are always going to be arguing against the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It is part of why it has autonomy," he concluded.\par \par \uc2 Tax reformThe economist participated in the tax dialogues and called for an evaluation of the process once it is complete. This, in view of voices such as that of the president of the Confederation of Production and Commerce (\uc2 CPC\uc2 ), Juan Sutil, who expected more pre-legislative work, and in view of the other positions that already highlight the process for having promoted meetings on the subject.\par \par \uc2 "It is important to calibrate, because we are seeing many pieces together. To see that the result of everything together does not cause too many serious problems for the investment. I understand that the structure is well thought out, but now we have to see that things come together," commented the director of the General Electricity Company (CGE), a company owned by the Chinese giant State Grid International Development (SGID).\par \par \uc2 The former Finance Minister also recalled that the last two tax reforms, during the second terms of Bachelet and \uc2 Sebasti\u225\'00\'E1n Pi\u241\'00\'F1era\uc2 , underwent "radical, very profound changes in the process".\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, Vald\u233\'00\'E9s put forward his ideas of disintegrating the tax system in order to simplify it and expand tax collection beyond the wealthiest sector of the population.\par \par \uc2 "Let's all pay more taxes, that means raising the rates of the global complementary, not only to the richest, but much lower", pointed out the economist, who added that he is concerned about the wealth tax: "It is very politicized, but we will see what rates they propose and if the set of these things makes sense or not".\par \par \uc2 On how he sees the burden of the current economic agenda, with reforms such as pensions, taxes and labor, Vald\u233\'00\'E9s pointed out that "it is something that is very difficult to digest for the economy and therefore it has to be done in a sequence, in a gradual way, that avoids deepening problems. This is not easy and implies less investment, at least in the transition, because it is more expensive to do business".\par \par \uc2 Regarding the new Constitution, Vald\u233\'00\'E9s reiterated his disappointment with the process, but did not define his position regarding the upcoming plebiscite to approve or reject the text elaborated by the Constituent Convention.\par \par \uc2 Continued in PulsoProducer Price Index rises again during May and registers its highest level since it began to be measured.Bloomberg calls Julio Ponce the "lithium king" but warns that his fortune is at risk from the governmentBanm\u233\'00\'E9dica expresses "concern and discomfort" to the Health Superintendency over rejection of plan increase and its controller requests a meeting with Chile's ambassador to the U.S.People who leave the labor market take 8.5 months to find a job again and regions in the extreme south have the longest delaysChange at Habitat: Cristi\u225\'00\'E1n Rodr\u237\'00\'EDguez will leave the presidency of the AFP to assume two other positions and Luis Rodr\u237\'00\'EDguez will take his place.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220624ei6o00arl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
