\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  reaffirms its decision not to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in the dollar market despite new historical high\b0\par\par\uc2 652 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juni 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The dollar registered a new historical maximum this Thursday, when it surpassed the $900 barrier, but this will not be a reason for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to try to influence its price, since the rise has logical explanations, according to the organization's view.\par \par \uc2 "There are good precedents to say that what has happened recently is linked to the fact that the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  (Fed) was half asleep regarding inflation", commented the vice-president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (\uc2 CB\uc2 ), Pablo Garc\u237\'00\'EDa, in the framework of a seminar of the Faculty of Economic and Administrative Sciences of the Universidad Austral de Chile (Uach).\par \par \uc2 The Metropolitan Region and the central and southern zones boosted the GDP in the first quarter of this year.In the activity of launching the Quarterly Regional Gross Domestic Product, Garc\u237\'00\'EDa referred for the second day to the exchange rate issue and stressed the idea that the rise of the dollar in Chile "responds to global phenomena. The dollar in the world is getting stronger (...) All the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world have tended to depreciate against the dollar".\par \par \uc2 Dollar continues its escalation and surpasses the $900 barrier in the face of the copper plungeAlthough the vice-president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  added that internal factors have pushed the dollar's price close to $150 or more, he emphasized that the increases from $815 are explained by the abrupt increase in rates by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  and the possible future increases that this organization and the market see in view of the advance of inflation.\par \par \uc2 "This is a much more aggressive rate hike scenario than I thought a month and a half ago, that is what is behind (the rise in the dollar)," said the economist.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  considered the option of applying an even greater increase in the interest rate at its last meeting.In view of this scenario, Garc\u237\'00\'EDa explained that the criteria for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the dollar market are not met. The vice-president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  pointed out that the behavior of the dollar in Chile is normal in relation to the fact that it responds to the floating exchange rate of the Chilean peso, that these movements can be explained and that they are not yet considered "disruptive for the macroeconomy".\par \par \uc2 In addition, he quoted the expression of the former president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Vittorio Corbo\uc2 , who said that "you have to be Tarzan to change the appreciation of the dollar" at this time.\par \par \uc2 Corbo dismisses \uc2 CB\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to the rise of the dollar in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 : "You have to be Tarzan to change its appreciation".However, Garc\u237\'00\'EDa stated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's action with its interest rate hikes has allowed counteracting part of the effect of the Fed's actions.\par \par \uc2 "If we did not have the interest rate we have today and we were just realizing, like the Fed, that there is an inflationary problem, it is a good thing we realized it a year ago (...) The impact we would be experiencing would be much greater", commented the economist when asked about a possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 Continue in Pulso Who is the leader of Codelco's workers? He has presided over the FTC for two months, is a former PC and has a brother who was detained and disappearedBusinessman Ren\u233\'00\'E9 Abumohor dies at 93 years oldInflation expectations overflowing: 2, 5, 5, 20 and 30 years are above the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's target of 3%.Dispute in Albala family continues: partners of the laboratory that manufactures Tapsin and Armonyl reject millionaire inheritance lawsuitGlobalization is on the retreat and will push up product prices: the warning of Jos\u233\'00\'E9 Manuel Silva, from LarrainVialTesla prepares its factory in China to double its production of electric vehicles\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220623ei6n00fu0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
