\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Exchange International Corp\uc2 . - How much  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  you need to go on vacation to Santiago, Chile\b0\par\par\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange International Corp. published this content on 11 Oct 2021 and is solely responsible for the information contained herein. Distributed by PUBT, unedited and unaltered, on 11 Oct 2021 14:08:06 UTC. \par \uc2 731 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Oktober 2021\par \uc2 Public Companies News and Documents via PUBT\par \uc2 LCDVP\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021. As included in the Information \par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ceifx.com/news/how-much-currency-you-need-to-go-on-vacation-to-santiago-chile"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here to view this document in its original format}}}\par \par \uc2 How much \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  you need to go on vacation to Santiago, Chile\par \par \uc2 Ordering Chilean Peso is easy with OnlineFX.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://order.ceifx.com/currency/20-Chile-Chilean-Peso"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ORDER CHILEAN PESO}}}\par \par \uc2 Planning your trip to Santiago, Chile? Know how much \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  you need to make sure you have a great trip! Don't forget to check out our guide for your stay in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ceifx.com/news/how-much-currency-you-need-to-go-on-vacation-to-barcelona-spain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Barcelona}}}\uc2 , too.\par \par \uc2 Transportation\par \par \uc2 In our how much \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bring abroad chart below, you'll see a 10-mile cab ride is on average about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://order.ceifx.com/currency/20-Chile-Chilean-Peso"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $12.20 USD}}}\uc2  in Santiago, Chile. Having this information on hand will give you a good idea of how much you would need to get around the city.\par \par \uc2 Food\par \par \uc2 Chilean food is a combination of traditional Spanish cuisine with influence by German, Italian and French cuisines. We recommend grabbing a bite at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.saritacoloniarestoran.cl/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sarita Colonia Restaurant}}}\uc2 , dishes here showcase a hybrid of flavors and techniques from Peru, Asia, and America. Pictured above is a traditional Chilean homemade pumpkin sopaipilla. This is a great appetizer with Chilean salsa or this can be served as a dessert, dusted with powdered sugar, or in a molasses sauce. As shown in our how much \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bring abroad chart above, it costs on average {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://order.ceifx.com/currency/28-Euro-Zone-European-Euro"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $16.82 USD}}}\uc2  for a budget dinner for two and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://order.ceifx.com/currency/28-Euro-Zone-European-Euro"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $4.21 USD}}}\uc2  for a pint of beer.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 : Chilean Peso (CLP)\par \par \uc2 The Chilean Pesos have five different denominations: $1000, $2000, $5000, $10000, $20000. The Chilean peso is considered to be a freely determined \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since 1999 however, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  can \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary. Learn more about \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://ceifx.com/news/5-currency-facts-you-probably-didn't-know-about-chilean-pesos"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 here}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Don't forget to add CXI's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ceifx.com/news/save-more-with-currency-price-protection-by-currency-exchange-international"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Currency\b0 \highlight22  Price Protection}}}\uc2 with your Chilean pesos - available at our CXI City Center locations. If you have leftover Chilean pesos after your trip to Santiago, CXI will buy protected \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  back from you at our ultimate buy-back rate plus no exchange fee! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://order.ceifx.com/currency/20-Chile-Chilean-Peso"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Order your Chilean pesos now}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Flights\par \par \uc2 Roundtrip tickets to Santiago, Chile for two typically range from about $826 USD to about $1,560 USD, depending on where you leave from, the airline you fly with, and when you are taking your trip, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.expedia.com/Cheap-Flights-To-Central-Chile.d6053652.Travel-Guide-Flights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Expedia}}}\uc2 . April appears as the best month to fly to Santiago in order to get cheaper flight prices, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cheapflights.com/flights-to-chile/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cheapflights.com}}}\uc2 . There you can find the best days of the week and the best time of year to book flights for your trips to other countries! Don't forget before you book that flight, check out everything you need to know about the five {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ceifx.com/news/tag/us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trusted travelers programs}}}\uc2  in our video below.\par \par \uc2 Vacation rentals\par \par \uc2 The average nightly cost for an \uc2 Airbnb\uc2  in Santiago, Chile is $41 - that's a great deal that won't break the bank. This allows you to experience Chile like the locals while also sparing your pesos for other amazing attractions Chile has to offer. Take a look at some of the best-rated super host places to stay in Santiago, Chile from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.airbnb.com/santiago-chile/stays"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Airbnb}}}\uc2  .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ceifx.com/news/cat/travel-tips"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Get more travel tips and news >}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ceifx.com/newsletters"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Subscribe now to platinum passport >}}}\par \par \uc2 About \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange International\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange International, CXI, is the leading provider of comprehensive \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  services, risk management solutions and integrated international payments processing technology in North America. CXI's relationship-driven approach ensures clients receive tailored solutions and world-class customer service. Through innovative and trusted \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  software platforms, CXI delivers versatile \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  services to our clients, so that they can efficiently manage and streamline their foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and global payment needs. CXI is a trusted partner among financial institutions, corporations and retail markets around the world. To learn more, visit: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ceifx.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.ceifx.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: All product names, logos, and brands are property of their respective owners. All company, product and service names used in this website are for identification purposes only. Use of these names, logos, and brands does not imply endorsement.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange International Corp\uc2 . published this content on 11 October 2021 and is solely responsible for the information contained therein. Distributed by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.publicnow.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Public}}}\uc2 , unedited and unaltered, on 11 October 2021 14:09:04 UTC.\par \par \uc2 Dokument LCDVP00020211011ehab00eia\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\