 de Elqui y Limar\u237\'00\'ED Ltda. These contracts stipulate a 3% annual interest on the capital with a term of eight years and annual payments. The last payment was paid on May 30, 2020. (5) Business \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  agreed upon Chilean pesos of the subsidiary Cervecer\u237\'00\'EDa Guayac\u225\'00\'E1n SpA. with Inversiones Diaguitas # 33 SpA., which will accrue interest corresponding to the nominal TAB rate of 30 days plus spread of 0.78% per year. This \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will mature on December 31, 2021. (6) Corresponds to shares of subsidiary Cervecer\u237\'00\'EDa Szot SpA. from subsidiary Cervecer\u237\'00\'EDa Kunstmann S.A. sold to Representaciones Chile Beer Kevin Michael Szot E.I.R.L. The total amount of the transaction raised ThCh$ 42,506 for the sale of 15,167 shares. An interest of UF plus 3.79% annually will be applied to the value (base 360 \u8203\'20\'0B\u8203\'20\'0Bdays). The account receivable will be paid by Representaciones Chile Beer Kevin Michael Szot E.I.R.L. to CK in the same proportion of the dividends it will receive from the participation it owns in Cervecer\u237\'00\'EDa Szot SpA.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The transaction table includes the main transactions made with related parties.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 F-75\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Compa\u241\'00\'F1\u237\'00\'EDa Cervecer\u237\'00\'EDas Unidas S.A. and subsidiaries\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 December 31, 2020\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The detail of the accounts receivable and payable from related are detailed as follows:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Accounts receivable from related parties\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Current:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Tax ID         Company                                                         Country of origin   Ref.   Relationship                              Transaction         \f28 \b \highlight22\u