ive and individual agreements entered into with certain groups of employees. Such obligation is determined by means of the current value of the benefit accrued cost, a method that considers several factors for the calculation such as estimates of future continuance, mortality rates, future salary increases and discount rates. The Company periodically evaluates the above-mentioned factors based on historical data and future projections, making adjustments that apply when checking changes sustained trend. The so-determined value is presented at the current value by using the severance benefits accrued method. The discount rate is determined by reference to market interest rates curves for high quality entrepreneurial bonds.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The discount rate in Chile was 4,41% (4,5% in 2019) and in Argentina 54,87% (49,14% in 2019).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 F-132\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Compa\u241\'00\'F1\u237\'00\'EDa Cervecer\u237\'00\'EDas Unidas S.A. and subsidiaries\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 December 31, 2020\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The obligation recorded for severance indemnity is detailed as follows:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Severance Indemnity   As of December 31, 2020   As of December 31, 2019 \par ThCh$                 ThCh$ \par Current               5,965,581                 - \par Non-current           35,678,357                33,571,138 \par Total                 41,643,938                33,571,138 \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The change in the severance indemnity is detailed as follows:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Severance Indemnity             ThCh$         \par                                \par \par Balance as of January 1, 2019   27,095,207    \par Current cost of service         2,457,762     \par Interest cost                   1,750,514     \par Actuarial (Gain) losses         4,086,158     \par Paid-up benefits                (1,773,734)   \par Past service cost               930