\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  suspends sale of spot market of  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  program\b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Januar 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported that from next Monday it will not sell dollars in the spot market under the current \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, although it will renew the current forwards stock, equivalent to US$ 4.5 billion. Already this week the institution had suspended spot sales.\par \par \uc2 Since the current program was announced on November 28, the dollar has fallen nearly $56, to trade today at around $773.\par \par \uc2 "Any increase in such a level, or restart of spot sales, will be communicated in a timely manner by the Council and decided on the basis of market conditions considering the volatility and liquidity prevailing," the statement said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 "The daily forward renewal schedule will continue to be reported every Friday, along with funding measures in pesos and dollars," he added.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program began on December 2 and provided for the sale of spot dollars for up to US$10 billion from reserves and the sale of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedging instruments for up to $10 billion. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  currently holds reserves of more than US$40 billion.\par \par \uc2 The last time the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on the market was in 2011 and is the largest \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of this size since 1999.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Banco Central de Chile\uc2  entry suspends the sale of dollars in spot market of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program was first published in La Tercera.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200110eg1a004ko\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
