\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Foreign betting against Chilean peso consolidates upward trend in early 2020\b0\par\par\uc2 564 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Januar 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 For several months now, foreign investors' bets on the Chilean peso have been carriers unusually.\par \par \uc2 This, because, contrary to the logic, when the dollar began to rise due to the social crisis the anti-local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bets were falling, while since the exchange rate began its bearish streak - at the end of November - the positions of the foreigners were steadily rising.\par \par \uc2 This under what is called carry trade, which consists of a strategy used in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading market where an investor sells a certain \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a relatively low interest rate and buys a different interest rate with an interest rate higher.\par \par \uc2 Beyond this dynamic, the upward trend of foreign weight positions continues to extend until the early days of 2020. Thus, between December 2, 2019, when they began to reverse the downturn, until January 3 of this year, the last available data on the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  website, they disarmed carry trade positions of US$3.912 million.\par \par \uc2 "There is no clarity on these latest movements of foreigners, it may be related to the vision of emerging economies in general \u8211\'20\'13 the one that has so far deteriorated - and, on the other hand, more so in particular, to a local economy that should internalize negative effects that arose after the crisis and should be reflected in the next figures," explains Martina Ogaz, EuroAmerica economist.\par \par \uc2 For his part, the head of Capitaria Trading Studies, Ricardo Bustamante, states that "Chile's weak macroeconomic figures and projections are likely to be supporting less confidence in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , especially after activity data economic that they strongly disappointed in recent months, coupled with the lack of clarity about the text of the agreement in its phase one, which created uncertainty in investors."\par \par \uc2 Exchange rateIn parallel, since geopolitical tensions between the United States and Iran broke out last Friday, after an attack by the former killed the Iranian military chief, the dollar has strengthened globally and felt strongly at the local level.\par \par \uc2 This Monday closed at $772.4, implying a $21.3 hike in just two days, which was also influenced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's announcement that the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week.\par \par \uc2 "Due to the brakes of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's exchange rate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week, coupled with increased uncertainty over the escalation of tensions between Iran and the United States, the dollar could continue to rise in the short term, considering that the most risky and linked to the economic cycle, such as emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and copper, should continue to be weakened," Bustamante said.\par \par \uc2 In that sense, it indicates that the next levels to consider are $780-788.\par \par \uc2 Ogaz, meanwhile, notes that "our scenario envisages a moderate depreciation of parity, all in line with an economy that over the coming months should begin to reflect the already more real effects of the impact of the crisis. In the meantime, there is added the uncertainty that the discussion and constituent process would cause, which would ultimately also impact the exchange rate."\par \par \uc2 For this reason, it anticipates parity would be $750 in a month, $755 in three months, and $770 by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 The entry Betting of foreigners against the Chilean peso consolidated upward trend in early 2020 was first published in La Tercera.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200214eg17009pv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
