of the year creates unfavourable seasonal dynamics, but I would expect the BRL, MXN, COP and CLP \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to start in 2020 with a stronger tone."\par \par \uc2 The entry \b \highlight22\uc2 Currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Latin America are no longer on the brink of collapse was first published in La Tercera.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020191205efc5004kw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
