\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  announces historic  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  to contain peso depreciation\b0\par\par\uc2 512 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 November 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  has announced a historic \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market of up to $20 billion from next Monday until May 2020. The decision has come after a further rise in the dollar against the Chilean peso, which changed to 828 pesos for each U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  setting new records. Six weeks after the social outburst, which has installed uncertainty in the Andean country from different fronts, the injection of the autonomous body responds to high volatility and seeks to stop the violent escalation of the US \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in front of the Chilean one. In the last two days it's gone up 30 pesos. Since October 18, the day the protests began, 116 pesos (a 16.7% increase).\par \par \uc2 "Beyond the level reached by the exchange rate, which partly importantly reflects greater uncertainty, the speed and succession of movements in the same direction have generated volatility that is deemed excessive," \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement. "Given the fundamentals of the Chilean economy, including low indexation to the dollar, exchange rate changes do not have an immediate impact on households, businesses and the public sector, and their move to inflation is generally moderate. Even so, excessive exchange rate volatility makes it difficult to form prices, and spending and production decisions for individuals and businesses. It also affects the healthy economy's adjustment and creates market unease," the bank added.\par \par \uc2 The last time the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was in 2011, however, it is the largest \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of its kind since the flexible exchange rate system debuted in Chile in 1999. The new and historic injection will be made through two modalities: spot dollar sales of up to $10 billion and sales of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedging instruments, also for up to $10 billion. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will apply from 2 December until 29 May. The agency will report every Friday the amount, terms and conditions of the auctions.\par \par \uc2 The market has reacted to the uncertainty that has been in Chile for six weeks. Protests and violence, which has failed to contain itself despite social ad measures and a new constitution that will have a plebiscite next April, have the country running at half-machine. The Treasury has not ruled out a technical recession in 2020 and an estimated 300,000 new unemployed people as of the end of December. The destruction of public and private infrastructure is still unquantifiable. According to guild calculations, some 20,000 small and medium-sized enterprises could file for bankruptcy due to the consequences of the social outburst. Large companies have also suffered: \uc2 Walmart\uc2  has accounted for 1,300 events - between shears and fires - that have left 35 supermarkets burned, 18 completely destroyed and 97 currently closed. "They have put the labor source of about 5,000 people at risk," \uc2 Walmart\uc2  said in a newsletter. After the announcement of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in after market transactions the dollar dropped by about 23 Chilean pesos, to 805.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020191129efbt001co\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
