\par\par \b \uc2 No sign of  \highlight22\uc2 Chile central bank \highlight \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  seen despite peso fall\b0\par\par\uc2 By Anthony Esposito and Antonio De la Jara   \par \uc2 463 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 2015\par 19:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Aug 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is nowhere near \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, economists said, despite the peso's fall to a 12-year low against the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The peso weakened sharply against the greenback this week, extending its year-to-date decline to 12.5 percent. It came close to breaching the 700 peso to the dollar mark for the first time since 2003, as fears over the Chinese economy have led down the price of copper, Chile's key export.\par \par \uc2 Out of nine economists and analysts surveyed by Reuters, three thought the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might decide to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the peso were to hit 750 per dollar, but others did not see an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely at all.\par \par \uc2 "I don't see any kinds of signs they are ready or inclined to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Tiago Severo, economist at \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "When we look at the language of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's communications it seems that they see this adjustment of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as part of a natural rebalancing of the market," he added.\par \par \uc2 The bank has made no attempt to talk down the peso but has expressed concern that risks from the Chinese economy and U.S. monetary policy could increase volatility and have a knock-on effect on inflation.\par \par \uc2 Of the world's 36 most-traded \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Chilean peso has posted the 6th biggest fall versus the dollar in 2015, trading at 696.70 on Friday, much weaker than prior forecasts.\par \par \uc2 FANNING INFLATION\par \par \uc2 Many of Latin America's central banks \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to a greater or lesser extent in their \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to shore up their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Colombia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far this year despite a 61 percent depreciation in its peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but analysts say that may change soon because of inflation worries. Policymakers meet to vote on the benchmark interest rate on Friday.\par \par \uc2 In Chile, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sharp drop has also fanned consumer prices, keeping 12-month inflation at the top end or above the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 2 percent to 4 percent target range since April 2014.\par \par \uc2 That could lead the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to respond by hiking interest rates, the economists said.\par \par \uc2 "It's possible that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will start to remove its monetary stimulus and hike interest rates by 25 or 50 basis points towards the end of 2015, regardless of weak economic growth," said Diego Colman, analyst with 4Cast. (Additional reporting by Felipe Iturrieta in Santiago and Julia Symmes Cobb in Bogota, writing by Anthony Esposito; Editing by Rosalba O'Brien and Meredith Mazzilli) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-8-21T18:33:48.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150821eb8l00m0d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
